  m_text: "11 \xB7 UI Trails \u2014 A2B effects with trails over a Canvas (via A2BUIParticle)\nComets
    streak from the chest to the wallet, each leaving a long bright tail ON the HUD.\nA
    TrailRenderer is world-space and cannot draw on a screen-space canvas; A2BTrailFeedback\ndetects
    the canvas and bakes every trail into one CanvasRenderer \u2014 sortable, one
    draw call."
